      <mxCell id="dt" value="&lt;b&gt;Defects caught by earlier iterations of this audit:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 1&amp;nbsp; arithmetic trend silently mis-compiled (valid SQL, wrong values)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;2&amp;nbsp; pointwise window divergence (1 patient in 294,788)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;3&amp;nbsp; ordering of simultaneous observations (spec gap)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2430;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="360" width="780" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
